{"id":72098,"date":"2026-10-30T14:15:24","date_gmt":"2026-10-30T14:15:24","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72098"},"modified":"2026-10-30T15:21:33","modified_gmt":"2026-10-30T14:21:33","slug":"maratona-de-houston","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-houston\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Houston 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Houston 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Houston 2027<\/strong> (54\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <em>Chevron Houston Marathon<\/em> e 25\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <em>Aramco Houston Half Marathon<\/em>) realiza-se nos dias <strong>16 e 17 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, em <strong>Houston, Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica<\/strong>. Com centro nevr\u00e1lgico no complexo <strong>George R. Brown Convention Center<\/strong> e no parque urbano <strong>Discovery Green<\/strong>, em pleno <em>Downtown Houston<\/em> (Texas), o evento norte-americano destaca-se internacionalmente pelo seu perfil de altimetria plano e r\u00e1pido, certificado pela <strong>USATF<\/strong> e pela <strong>World Athletics<\/strong>, sendo uma das provas de inverno mais procuradas para obten\u00e7\u00e3o de marcas de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o e recordes pessoais.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo arranca no s\u00e1bado, <strong>16 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, com a corrida <strong>We Are Houston 5K presented by Aramco and Chevron (5 km)<\/strong>, cuja partida ocorre no cruzamento de <strong>McKinney St. &amp; Crawford St.<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>07:50<\/strong> (cadeiras de rodas e handcycle) e \u00e0s <strong>08:00<\/strong> (pelot\u00e3o geral distribu\u00eddo pelos Corrais A, B, C e D at\u00e9 \u00e0s 08:30). No domingo, <strong>17 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, a linha de partida \u00fanica em <strong>Congress Ave. &amp; Fannin St.<\/strong> acolhe simultaneamente a <strong>Maratona (42,195 km)<\/strong> e a <strong>Meia Maratona (21,0975 km)<\/strong>: as divis\u00f5es de cadeiras de rodas e handcycle partem \u00e0s <strong>06:35<\/strong>, a elite da Meia Maratona \u00e0s <strong>06:45<\/strong>, e a elite da Maratona seguida dos seis corrais do pelot\u00e3o geral (Corrais A a F, em vagas pulsadas) \u00e0s <strong>06:55<\/strong>, percorrendo bairros emblem\u00e1ticos como <em>The Heights<\/em>, <em>Montrose<\/em>, <em>Rice University<\/em>, <em>Memorial Park<\/em> e <em>Tanglewood<\/em> at\u00e9 \u00e0 reta da meta em <strong>Lamar St. &amp; Crawford St.<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>Houston Marathon Committee<\/strong> (institui\u00e7\u00e3o sem fins lucrativos fundada em 1972), a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027 esgotou as 5 fases gerais de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o (<em>Tier 1 a Tier 5<\/em>, entre 160 USD e 210 USD) para os 42,195 km e os 21,0975 km, mantendo inscri\u00e7\u00f5es abertas para a <strong>We Are Houston 5K<\/strong> (<strong>60 USD<\/strong> no Tier 5) e dorsais solid\u00e1rios atrav\u00e9s do programa oficial <strong>Run for a Reason<\/strong> (<em>Houston Marathon Foundation<\/em>). O levantamento obrigat\u00f3rio do dorsal decorre na <strong>Houston Marathon Health &amp; Fitness EXPO presented by Houston Methodist<\/strong>, no 3\u00ba piso do <strong>George R. Brown Convention Center<\/strong> (Hall B3\/A3), na sexta-feira (15 de janeiro, das 10:00 \u00e0s 18:00) e no s\u00e1bado (16 de janeiro, das 08:30 \u00e0s 17:00). Consulta tamb\u00e9m o guia completo das principais <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e planeia o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">16 a 17 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">George R. Brown Convention Center (Congress Ave & Fannin St), Houston, Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Maratona (42,195 km), Meia Maratona (21,0975 km) e We Are Houston 5K (5 km)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Houston Marathon Committee<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6h00m (Maratona)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tipo de Piso<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Asfalto e art\u00e9rias urbanas certificadas pela USATF<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Perfil & Relevo<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Plano e r\u00e1pido<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Log\u00edstica & Apoio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Secretariado na Houston Marathon Health & Fitness EXPO (George R. Brown Convention Center, Hall B3\/A3), apoio m\u00e9dico Houston Methodist, equipas de pacers e festa p\u00f3s-prova RunFest no Discovery Green<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.chevronhoustonmarathon.com\/schedule\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li><div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas & Sub-eventos<\/strong><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Chevron Houston Marathon (42,195 km) \u2013 Pelot\u00e3o Geral (Corrais A a F)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 06:55 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: 6h00m<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Tiers 1 a 5 (Geral):<\/strong> 160 a 210 USD<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Esgotado)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Programa Solid\u00e1rio Run for a Reason:<\/strong> 300 a 600 USD<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Vagas limitadas)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Chevron Houston Marathon (42,195 km) \u2013 Elite & Cadeiras de Rodas \/ Handcycle<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 06:35 \/ 06:55 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: 6h00m<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">160 a 210 USD<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Meia Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Aramco Houston Half Marathon (21,0975 km) \u2013 Pelot\u00e3o Geral (Corrais A a F)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 06:55<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Meia Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Aramco Houston Half Marathon (21,0975 km) \u2013 Elite & Cadeiras de Rodas<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 06:35 \/ 06:45<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">We Are Houston 5K presented by Aramco & Chevron (5 km \u2013 Corrais A a D)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 16 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Add-on simult\u00e2neo (Maratona\/Meia):<\/strong> 40 USD<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Esgotado)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Tier 5 (Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Individual):<\/strong> 60 USD<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es abertas)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Maratona de Houston 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Maratona de Houston 2027 (54\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Chevron Houston Marathon e 25\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Aramco Houston Half Marathon) realiza-se no fim de semana de 16 e 17 de Janeiro de 2027 em Downtown Houston (Texas, Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica). A corrida We Are Houston 5K disputa-se no s\u00e1bado, 16 de janeiro, com partida em McKinney St. & Crawford St., enquanto a Maratona e a Meia Maratona partem no domingo, 17 de janeiro, em Congress Ave. & Fannin St., terminando em Lamar St. & Crawford St., junto ao George R. Brown Convention Center e ao Discovery Green.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida de todas as provas em 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No s\u00e1bado, 16 de Janeiro de 2027, a We Are Houston 5K (5 km) parte \u00e0s 07:50 para a divis\u00e3o de cadeiras de rodas e handcycle, seguindo-se as vagas por corrais: Corrais A e B \u00e0s 08:00, Corral C e estudantes \u00e0s 08:15, e Corral D \u00e0s 08:30. No domingo, 17 de Janeiro de 2027, a Maratona e a Meia Maratona iniciam-se \u00e0s 06:35 com cadeiras de rodas e handcycle, \u00e0s 06:45 com a Elite da Meia Maratona e \u00e0s 06:55 com a Elite da Maratona e os seis corrais do pelot\u00e3o geral (Corrais A a F em partida pulsada).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual o estado das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e pre\u00e7os para a Maratona de Houston 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As cinco fases regulares de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o (Tier 1 a Tier 5, com valores entre 160 USD e 210 USD na Maratona) encontram-se esgotadas para os 42,195 km e para os 21,0975 km devido \u00e0 elevada procura. Os atletas ainda podem garantir dorsal na Maratona ou Meia Maratona atrav\u00e9s do programa solid\u00e1rio oficial Run for a Reason (com angaria\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00ednima ou donativo para as institui\u00e7\u00f5es parceiras) ou inscrever-se diretamente na prova de s\u00e1bado We Are Houston 5K pelo valor de 60 USD (Tier 5).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os tempos de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o para o Corral A e qual o tempo limite (cut-off)?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os atletas que pretendam partir no Corral A (Front Corral Seeding) devem submeter na sua conta de participante, at\u00e9 30 de novembro de 2026, um tempo oficial por chip obtido a partir de 1 de janeiro de 2025 numa prova certificada: sub-3:29:59 na Maratona, sub-1:44:59 na Meia Maratona, sub-1:14:34 em 10 Milhas ou sub-0:45:38 nos 10 km. O tempo limite oficial (cut-off) da Maratona de Houston \u00e9 de 6h00m l\u00edquidos (ritmo m\u00e9dio de 13m45s por milha).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona a Expo para levantamento do dorsal?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do kit de atleta e dorsal realiza-se na Houston Marathon Health & Fitness EXPO presented by Houston Methodist, localizada no 3\u00ba piso do George R. Brown Convention Center (Hall B3\/A3), na sexta-feira, 15 de Janeiro de 2027 (das 10:00 \u00e0s 18:00), e no s\u00e1bado, 16 de Janeiro de 2027 (das 08:30 \u00e0s 17:00). Para os atletas da We Are Houston 5K existe ainda levantamento de dorsal no pr\u00f3prio s\u00e1bado a partir das 06:30.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Houston 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-16\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-16\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"George R. Brown Convention Center (Congress Ave & Fannin St), Houston, Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Houston\", \"addressRegion\": \"Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica\", \"addressCountry\": \"US\"}}, \"description\": 